{"code":"PK27","wikidata":"Q123537787","wikipedia":{"en":"Bang Chan MRT station","th":"สถานีบางชัน"},"summary":{"en":"Bang Chan station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. The station is located on Ram Inthra Road, near Soi Ram Inthra 115 in Min Buri district, Bangkok. The station has four exits and serves Bang Chan Industrial Estate.","th":"สถานีบางชัน เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพู โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนรามอินทราในพื้นที่เขตมีนบุรี กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/MRT_Pink_Line_Bang_Chan_Station_20231203-1.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Bang_Chan_Station_20231203-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Bang_Chan_Station_20231203-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/MRT_Pink_Line_Bang_Chan_Station_20231203-2.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Bang_Chan_Station_20231203-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Bang_Chan_Station_20231203-2.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/MRT_Pink_Line_Bang_Chan_Station_20231203-3.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Bang_Chan_Station_20231203-3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Bang_Chan_Station_20231203-3.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/MRT_Pink_Line_Bang_Chan_Station_20231203-4.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Bang_Chan_Station_20231203-4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Bang_Chan_Station_20231203-4